Run every criterion bench at <commit> and at the working tree, and fail if a median is more than 10% slower outside the noise (bench.yml)

Usage: cargo xtask bench-compare --base <commit>

Options:
      --base <commit>
          The commit to compare with

  -h, --help
          Print help
